&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NaturalMotion is looking for a talented and passionate Enemy Designer to join our London studio, helping shape the combat experience for our first-person shooter mobile title. This role focuses on implementing well known enemies, adapting existing enemies and adding new compelling enemies to bring an authentic console experience to mobile&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting at the intersection of design, art, animation, audio, and engineering, you will ensure enemy encounters are polished, purposeful and fun. A core responsibility will be working with Level Design &amp;amp; Combat Design to ensure every enemy encounter is polished, purposeful, and fun. We are looking for someone who brings both craft knowledge and a genuine love of action games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role you will work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of designing, prototyping, and implementing enemy behaviours, AI systems, boss encounters &amp;amp; other features that align with the creative vision of the game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take enemies and bosses from paper design through to shipping quality, ensuring they are complete, polished and fun for players&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Level Design &amp;amp; Combat Design to ensure enemies, factions, and NPCs meet their goals at every stage of development. Define required metrics to track and achieve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with art, animation, audio, design and engineering teams to build content and solve problems in a multi-disciplinary environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and balance a diverse roster of enemies, bosses, mutators &amp;amp; more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create compelling AI behaviours &amp;amp; attack patterns that provide an exciting experience and appropriately challenging for players&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse combat data, player feedback, and internal playtests to refine and iterate on enemy and boss designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work concurrently on multiple features at varying stages of development, managing priorities effectively as content pipelines run in parallel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and communicate enemy and boss design concepts clearly to ensure alignment across all development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
