&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, our mission is to make money work for everyone, everywhere. We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Technical Program Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to help ship more and better payment product offerings. This is a high-impact role that demands both technical expertise and exceptional leadership to drive our ambitious goals.&lt;/p&gt;
